      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fTk3S",
          "fill": "#000000",
          "content": "I think the mistake that the agents took initially was it was that they thought that the whole screen was what the user would see. But as I mentioned before, that that that's not really the case. The case is that it's like a web view. A very good example is the first reference we have of like how it could be better. And because of the proportions and like the sizing and everything really matches how it actually loads in the browser. So pay attention to that as well. I don't know if that would work for some inspiration or something, but pay attention to that.",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
