          "name": "Text Rules Body",
          "fill": "#C8D0E0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Pills: 12 px minimum text, 700 weight, 8 px vertical / 12 px horizontal padding, and content-driven width.\n\nButtons: 12 px minimum text, 700–800 weight, 10 px vertical / 16 px horizontal padding, with at least 8 px between icon and label.\n\nShort actions stay on one line. Longer copy belongs in a wider control or wraps in a field—never clip, truncate, or force text against a border.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "DM Sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        }
      ]
