    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "TEIIO",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 96774,
      "name": "Note · Landing Option B",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "LANDING · OPTION B (draft)\n\nChicago: skyline only in the hero and the footer. Everything between sits on calm night ground (#090B1C) so the content leads.\n\nNew order: Hero (what + Join + See events + next event) → Coming up → People, not just programs (photos, quote, where members land) → What you get → Join → Supported by (slim strip) → Footer.\n\nPLACEHOLDERS — do not ship: the 4 desktop / 2 phone photos are stock images, and the 'Aisha K.' quote and event cards are mock content. Replace with real member photos (with consent), a real quote, and live events from /api/events.\n\nPartner details move to /partner; the home page keeps one logo strip."
    },
