                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1000,
                  "content": "Station names look like CTA platform signs. A 3-car train sits at the section you're on and glides to the next. Passed track turns ember, track ahead stays a hairline. Ties on the rail make it read as a track, not a timeline.",
